  Text: "It's green, it glows, it's gooey and it's coming out of a <link>trucks behind</link>.
    It\u2019s quite the paranormal clich\xE9! \n\nWe have to get rid of it.\n\r \nAlso,
    someone rode all over it with <link>a small vehicle</link>  leaving glowing <link>tricycle
    tracks</link> that go south down <link>the road</link>. \n \nWe might want to
    check that out. \r"
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?


    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
